SUMMARY:KSJ + STS Fall Lecture - The Fight for Facts: Evidence in an Age of
  Doubt
LOCATION:MIT\, 77 Massachusetts Ave\, Cambridge\, MA 02139
DESCRIPTION:The Program in Science\, Technology\, and Society and the Knigh
 t Science Journalism Program invite you on Tuesday\, November 10th at 4:30
  pm in the Nexus at Hayden Library (14S-130) for a special lecture\, "The 
 Fight for Facts: Evidence in an Age of Doubt\," that explores the rise of 
 evidence-based thinking\, the power of scientific consensus\, and the forc
 es that work to distort\, undermine\, and dismiss facts.\nhttps://calendar
 .mit.edu/event/ksj-sts-fall-lecture-the-fight-for-facts-evidence-in-an-age
 -of-doubt\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.city/boston/
